{"strongs": "H0119", "word": "אָדֹם", "translit": "a.dam", "root": "אדם", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "be red", "definition": "[ אָדֹם , אָדֵם ] verb be red (on formation compare Lag BN 83 compare 120) — Qal Perfect 3 plural אָֽדְמוּ ruddy , of Nazirites Lam 4:7 Pu`al Participle reddened, dyed red , מְאָדָּם Nah 2:4 (of shield), מְאָדָּמִים of rams' skins Exod 25:5 ; Exod 26:14 ; Exod 35:7 ; Exod 35:23 ; Exod 36:19 ; Exod 39:34 (all P ). Hithpa`el Imperfect redden, grow or look red , יִתְאַדָּ֑ם Prov 23:31 (of wine); Hiph`il Imperfect emit (show) redness (compare Lag BN 120 ) יַאְדִּימוּ כַתּוֺלָע Isa 1:18 (of sins) i.e. be glaring, flagrant (compare also v Isa 1:15 ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB113')\">BDB113</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H119')\">H119</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB112')\">BDB112</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB114')\">BDB114</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>אָדֹם</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>אָדֵם</bdbheb>] <b>verb</b> <highlightword>be red</highlightword> (on formation compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>BN 83</sup></lookup> compare 120) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 plural <bdbheb>אָֽדְמוּ</bdbheb> <highlight>ruddy</highlight>, of Nazirites <ref ref=\"Lam 4:7\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(25,4,7)\">Lam 4:7</ref> <b>Pu`al</b> <highlight>Participle reddened, dyed red</highlight>, <bdbheb>מְאָדָּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Nah 2:4\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(34,2,4)\">Nah 2:4</ref> (of shield), <bdbheb>מְאָדָּמִים</bdbheb> of rams' skins <ref ref=\"Exod 25:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,5)\">Exod 25:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 26:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,26,14)\">Exod 26:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 35:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,7)\">Exod 35:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 35:23\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,23)\">Exod 35:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 36:19\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(2,36,19)\">Exod 36:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 39:34\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(2,39,34)\">Exod 39:34</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). <b>Hithpa`el</b> <highlight>Imperfect redden, grow</highlight> or <highlight>look red</highlight>, <bdbheb>יִתְאַדָּ֑ם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 23:31\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(20,23,31)\">Prov 23:31</ref> (of wine); <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Imperfect emit (show) redness</highlight> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>BN 120</sup></lookup>) <bdbheb>יַאְדִּימוּ כַתּוֺלָע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 1:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,18)\">Isa 1:18</ref> (of sins) i.e. be glaring, flagrant (compare also v<ref ref=\"Isa 1:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,15)\">Isa 1:15</ref>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Lam 4:7", "book": "LAM", "chapter": 4, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Nah 2:4", "book": "NAM", "chapter": 2, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Exod 25:5", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 25, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Exod 26:14", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 26, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Exod 35:7", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 35, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Exod 35:23", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 35, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Exod 36:19", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 36, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Exod 39:34", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 39, "verse": 34}, {"raw": "Prov 23:31", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 23, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "Isa 1:18", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 1, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Isa 1:15", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 1, "verse": 15}], "flagg